    title: "ECOWAS-AES in Dakar: A Framework Agreement to Build, Interdependencies to Secure",
    excerpt: "On 17 October 2026, ECOWAS and the Confederation of Sahel States signed a joint communiqué in Dakar setting up working groups to prepare a cooperation framework agreement. A reading of the text and its silences, what each side stands to gain or lose, and a proposed architecture to make this cooperation work.",
    tags: ["ECOWAS", "AES", "Free movement", "Corridors", "Regional integration", "Sahel"], category: "Sahel Geopolitics",
